    'connect.cfg_hint' => $t('Each row is AppId,Secret. Login shows QQ / WeChat buttons. Weibo is stored only, like Apple CMS, and does not log in. Callbacks /connect/qq/callback, /connect/wechat/callback.', '每项写成 AppId,Secret。登录页会出现 QQ / 微信按钮。微博与苹果 CMS 一样不接通登录。回调地址 /connect/qq/callback、/connect/wechat/callback。', 'Jede Zeile AppId,Secret. Login zeigt QQ / WeChat. Weibo nur gespeichert, kein Login. Callbacks /connect/qq/callback, /connect/wechat/callback.', 'Cada fila es AppId,Secret. El login muestra QQ / WeChat. Weibo solo se guarda, no entra. Callbacks /connect/qq/callback, /connect/wechat/callback.', 'Chaque ligne est AppId,Secret. La connexion montre QQ / WeChat. Weibo est seulement stocké. Callbacks /connect/qq/callback, /connect/wechat/callback.', '각 줄은 AppId,Secret. 로그인에 QQ / 위챗 버튼. 웨이보는 저장만, 로그인 안 됨. 콜백 /connect/qq/callback, /connect/wechat/callback.', 'Cada linha é AppId,Secret. O login mostra QQ / WeChat. Weibo só se guarda, não entra. Callbacks /connect/qq/callback, /connect/wechat/callback.', '各行は AppId,Secret。ログインに QQ / WeChat。Weibo は保存のみでログインしない。コールバック /connect/qq/callback、/connect/wechat/callback。'),
